{"id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-recursive-function.md","title":"Recursive Function","display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-recursive-function","aliases":["92-df-recursive-function"],"display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-pr-function]]","[[92-df-composition]]","[[92-df-recursion-operator]]","[[92-df-unbounded-minimization]]"],"source":"第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）","source_status":"原书递归概念的本地 μ 闭包呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-recursive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-recursive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8940b60e44b8fbd8\" href=\"?note=8940b60e44b8fbd8\" title=\"92-df-recursion-operator\">92-df-recursion-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f3056569f28b91e\" href=\"?note=3f3056569f28b91e\" title=\"92-df-unbounded-minimization\">92-df-unbounded-minimization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书递归概念的本地 μ 闭包呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity and partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span> (composition operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\\)</span> (recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8940b60e44b8fbd8\" href=\"?note=8940b60e44b8fbd8\" title=\"92-df-recursion-operator\">92-df-recursion-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_k\">\\(\\mu_k\\)</span> (unbounded minimization, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3f3056569f28b91e\" href=\"?note=3f3056569f28b91e\" title=\"92-df-unbounded-minimization\">92-df-unbounded-minimization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PF},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathsf{PF},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (definition-target partial-function universe and classes)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PartRec}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{PF}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \\mathrm{PR}\\subseteq C\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^m\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\bigl(C\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\bigr)^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu_k(g)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rec}(f)&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PartRec}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{PF}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \\mathrm{PR}\\subseteq C\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^m\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\bigl(C\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\bigr)^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu_k(g)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rec}(f)&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是递归函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 是部分递归函数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 在其全部输入上有定义</li>\n<li>“递归函数 = 可计算函数”是与具体机器模型的等价定理，不是本定义自身的内容</li>\n<li>由相应算术可表示性定理，部分递归函数的图可在足够强且有效编码的算术系统中表示；这不是闭包定义本身自动推出的</li>\n<li>Smullyan将可计算性与可表示性联系起来</li>\n<li>这是证明不完备性的技术基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书以 R 和其补关系都 Σ₁ 为 recursive 的定义，以总函数的 graph 为 recursive 定义 recursive function。原书版本及总性用途见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" href=\"?note=cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations\">92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fffc9733e4a34483\" href=\"?note=fffc9733e4a34483\" title=\"92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function\">92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function</a>。本文 PartRec 是包括部分函数的另一个标准构造，不应把原书关于总图补关系的论证照搬到所有 PartRec 图。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"8940b60e44b8fbd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-unbounded-minimization","status":"resolved","id":"3f3056569f28b91e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-unbounded-minimization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-pr-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"8940b60e44b8fbd8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecOp}_k$ (recursion operator, see [[92-df-recursion-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-unbounded-minimization","status":"resolved","id":"3f3056569f28b91e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu_k$ (unbounded minimization, see [[92-df-unbounded-minimization]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations","status":"resolved","id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书以 R 和其补关系都 Σ₁ 为 recursive 的定义，以总函数的 graph 为 recursive 定义 recursive function。原书版本及总性用途见 [[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]、[[92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function]]。本文 PartRec 是包括部分函数的另一个标准构造，不应把原书关于总图补关系的论证照搬到所有 PartRec 图。","embed":false},{"target":"92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function","status":"resolved","id":"fffc9733e4a34483","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书以 R 和其补关系都 Σ₁ 为 recursive 的定义，以总函数的 graph 为 recursive 定义 recursive function。原书版本及总性用途见 [[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]、[[92-prop-smullyan-total-sigma1-function]]。本文 PartRec 是包括部分函数的另一个标准构造，不应把原书关于总图补关系的论证照搬到所有 PartRec 图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PF},\\mathrm{PartRec},\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{PF}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PartRec}&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{PF}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \\mathrm{PR}\\subseteq C\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^m\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in\\bigl(C\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\bigr)^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap(\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu_k(g)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rec}(f)&\\leftrightarrow f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":2929,"backlinks":[{"id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"3a189f7ee36e22f0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ (partial-recursive function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"127af5e2492cd2af","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ (partial-recursive function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"19c8b0267ad22ce9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed acceptable enumeration of unary partial-recursive functions, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"301cfe50f6e97873","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ (partial-recursive function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"a3421dd0a360a650","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed effective enumeration of $k$-ary partial recursive functions, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"bb38790ef6a3828c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PF},\\mathrm{PartRec}$ (partial-function universe and partial-recursive class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地 [[92-df-recursive-function]] 与 [[92-df-ce-set]] 给另一套计算模型定义。两种刻画的标准等价性属于递归论背景，原书不依赖 Church–Turing 哲学论题来命名本定义。"},{"id":"0a7ed5215db80540","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"659d57dcf656b1a5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"8773b1cdac488c9d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"6c4d7648de3418cf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ac4388db49632759","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e09695d13f301942","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ (recursive-function predicate for $f$, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"e1cdd4c4623e324f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bd304cf92255e65e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total recursive-function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]"}],"outgoing":["736154be0fae643a","7d55d92fc12a07fc","8940b60e44b8fbd8","3f3056569f28b91e","cc77d3ecb4